OL,3,AUS unveils sanctions on ICC in move
OL,4,Acourt condemns as 'assault on rule of
OL,5,Alaw'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Trump administration has unveiled
OL,8,Fsweeping sanctions on the International
OL,9,FCriminal Court (ICC) in a significant
OL,10,Facceleration of its attempt to
OL,11,F"dismantle" what it sees as a "rogue"
OL,12,Finstitution.
OL,14,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio said
OL,15,Fthe measures - which include a ban on
OL,16,FUS entities making transactions with
OL,17,Fthe ICC - were intended to "defend US
OL,18,Fsovereignty" and accused the court of
OL,19,Fseeking to prosecute Americans.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
